title: Beginning
---
<<declare $goodend = 0>>
<<declare $badend = 0>>
<<playMusic frisscityCalm>>
//This needs to be updated with the correct location
<<camera Understory>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
Luna: Come on, you stupid SL0P app. Show me the big offers!
<<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>>
Luna: (Kaya is gonna kill me if I skip out on rent again. Just one big delivery gig should help me break even…)
//Play the Cyberdeck Notification ping
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
<<show_notification 0>>
Luna: (Huh? It’s a new customer rating on the SL0P app. I better tap it and check it out…)
<<jump BR>>
===

title: BR
---
////////// We need to remove the asset of Luna leaning on her motorbike before we slide in Luna’s character sprite from the left.
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>>
Luna: You've got to be joking.
Luna: (I have an option to respond…)
-> Don't respond and close the app
    <<set $goodend += 1>>
    Luna: Ugh, whatever.
    I close the app because these people aren’t worth my time.
    Frisscity is home to the ultra-rich who eat up trends, get hooked up with the latest AGENTS tech stack, and want to discover the next worst thing for society.
    //////////<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna shyAnnnoyed>>
    They're fake freaks. And they don't tip.
    I don't wanna deal with them any more than I have to. Frisscity's just where I work. I can't wait for this day to be over so I can get back to my real life in Root Town.
    <<jump CyberdeckT>>
-> Give the reviewer a 1-star rating
    ///////<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaHappy>>
    Luna: Heh, shove it.
    I give Karen a 1-star rating right back, noting how her fruitarian and vegan preferences were never mentioned in the app.
    ////////<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
    I'm waiting for the day everyone in Frisscity finally decides to upload their brains to the cloud. If the AGENTS founder does it, I'm sure they’ll do it.    
    But me? I’d never fall for a capitalist trick like that.
    Me and Root Town refuse to integrate with AGENTS technology. Life outside of AGENTS and Frisscity is hard, but it's real. And it's home.
    <<jump CyberdeckT>>
-> Doxx their address on an online forum for SL0P drivers
    <<set $badend += 1>>
    Instead of leaving them a review, I do much worse. I post their address on a public online forum and warn fellow drivers from Root Town not to take delivery orders from them.
    ///////<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaHappyArms>>
    Luna: Now all of SL0P will know what you have done. Good luck getting your stupid apples and cheese.
    ////////<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedArms>>
    This is the shit I put up with in Frisscity. I break my back for baecoins for people who chase trends and chase surgeries to get hooked up with the latest AGENTS technology.
    But me? I refuse to be augmented.
    I wish Frisscity would just disappear.
    <<jump CyberdeckT>>
===

title: CyberdeckT
---
